title: Zentrum Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and player_party = 'z' and (dissent >= 0.3 or (left_dissent > 30 and not left_leaders_resigned) or (center_dissent > 30 and not center_leaders_resigned) or (right_dissent > 30 and not right_wing_left) or (christian_unity_dissent > 30 and not christian_unity_left) or (anti_fascist_dissent > 30 and anti_fascist_available and not anti_fascists_left) or (barons_dissent > 30))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/Reichstagsfraktion_der_SPD.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs


= Zentrum Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if left_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Left</span> faction is making noises about splitting. ?]
[? if center_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #888888;">Center</span> faction is displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if right_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #3A7ACC;">Right</span> faction threatens to leave. ?]
[? if christian_unity_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #006400;">Christian Unity</span> faction considers forming a new party. ?]
[? if anti_fascist_dissent > 30 and anti_fascist_available : The <span style="color: #006400;">Anti-Fascist</span> faction despairs of the party's resolve against Nazism. ?]
[? if barons_dissent > 30 : The <span style="color: #8B4513;">Barons</span> faction is unhappy with the party's course. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_left
- @concessions_center
- @concessions_right
- @concessions_christian_unity
- @concessions_anti_fascist
- @concessions_barons
- @do_nothing
- @easy_discard

@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 8; right_dissent -= 8; christian_unity_dissent -= 8; anti_fascist_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent -= 8; workers_z -= (dissent * 10); new_middle_z -= (dissent * 5); unemployed_z -= (dissent * 5); rural_z -= (dissent * 5); catholics_z -= (dissent * 5)

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

@concessions_left
title: Give concessions to the Left.
view-if: left_dissent > 30
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 8; right_dissent += 5; christian_unity_dissent += 5

We have promised that we will listen to the Left wing of the party. Of course, this leads to increased dissent from the Center, Right, and Christian Unity factions.

@concessions_center
title: Give concessions to the Center.
view-if: center_dissent > 30
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 15; left_dissent += 8; right_dissent += 8; christian_unity_dissent += 5

We have promised to take more policy suggestions from the centrists. The Left, Right, and Christian Unity wings of the party might be displeased.

@concessions_right
title: Give concessions to the Right.
view-if: right_dissent > 30
on-arrival: right_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 8; christian_unity_dissent += 8; left_dissent += 10

We have promised to adopt a more conservative posture. This may alienate the Left and Christian Unity factions, however.

@concessions_christian_unity
title: Give concessions to Christian Unity.
view-if: christian_unity_dissent > 30
on-arrival: christian_unity_dissent -= 15; right_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 8; left_dissent += 10; anti_fascist_dissent += 8

We have promised to pursue a cross-confessional Christian democratic course. The Left and Anti-Fascist factions are alarmed.

@concessions_anti_fascist
title: Give concessions to the Anti-Fascists.
view-if: anti_fascist_dissent > 30 and anti_fascist_available
on-arrival: anti_fascist_dissent -= 15; left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; right_dissent += 10; christian_unity_dissent += 5; bvp_relations -= 5

We have promised to prioritize the struggle against Nazism above all else. The Right and Christian Unity factions are displeased, and the BVP is uneasy.

@concessions_barons
title: Give concessions to the Barons.
view-if: barons_dissent > 30
on-arrival: barons_dissent -= 15; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5; anti_fascist_dissent += 10; presidential_opinion += 3

We have accommodated the aristocratic-military faction's desire for authoritarian stabilization. The Left and Anti-Fascists are outraged. Hindenburg is mildly pleased.

@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: left_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 1; right_dissent += 1; christian_unity_dissent += 1; anti_fascist_dissent += 1; barons_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.